<!----inner contents---->
<section>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="InnerContents">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-8 col-md-8 txtPads">
                    <h3>Wordutopia</h3>
                    <!--<p>Allow Users to create tests in random format with or without timers. Moreover, User databases can be shared with anyone across the globe with or without secure passwords.</p>-->
                    <p>Wordutopia allows Users to create a database of English vocabulary words that they can then randomly test their understanding of. To assist them with this process, Users can populate fields that offer hints as to the meaning of each test word, phonetically spell the pronounciation of each word, or add a captured phrase from a book, article, magazine, movie etc  In addition to basic random testing, Users can create tests using timers, share tests with other Users with or without passwords, post words, phrases and definitions etc to the main community of Users, create random crosswords, and even Reverse test their understanding where they see the definition and have to recall the root word. And so much more, just click on the DEMO section for a full list of features. This application was created to help you speak and write better English, and with the help of the online community your confidence for articulating words and phrases will soon sore. Enjoy!</p>
                    <!--<a class="readBtn" href="#">Read More</a>-->
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-4 Innerimg">
                    <img src="~/Content/img/wordutopia.png" />
                </div>
                <div class="uparr">
                    @*<a href="/Home/Index"><img src="~/Content/img/arrowup.png" /></a>*@
                    <a href="javascript:;" id="scrollToTop1"><img src="~/Content/img/arrowup.png" /></a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
